OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist seriously hurt in
OL,4,Acrash near hospital
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 45-year-old motorcyclist has been
OL,7,Fleft seriously injured after a crash
OL,8,Fnear Bradford Royal Infirmary.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called at about
OL,11,F22:15 BST on Thursday to reports of a
OL,12,Fcollision between a silver Seat Leon
OL,13,Fcar and a red Yamaha R6 motorbike on
OL,14,FSmith Lane outside the hospital's Gate
OL,15,F6 entrance.
OL,17,FThe motorcyclist was taken to hospital
OL,18,Ffor emergency treatment, West Yorkshire
OL,19,FPolice said, with his condition
OL,20,Fdescribed as stable.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
